+/* ---- 3 · the pill transitions (pill.js, pt.css) ---- */
+/* the window over a case page's frame (z 95) and the map's interface */
+/* r235: the case page's pill (pill.js). At rest the frame's four boxes are the screen and cut nothing; while it runs
+   (.czpf-run) each is a little bigger than the screen, rounds one corner, and is moved (transforms only, the
